# getdr

`getdr` is a small open-source command-line tool by [Index Pages](https://index-pages.com) that checks
Ahrefs Domain Rating (DR) for one domain, a list, a file or stdin. It uses only the official free Ahrefs
endpoint, keeps a local history of every check in SQLite, and can run as a tiny HTTP API (`getdr serve`)
so every machine and agent on your network shares one cache and one key.

Docs: [index-pages.com/getdr/]({{.Homepage}}) · Source: [github.com/index-pages/getdr]({{.Repo}})

## Install
{{if eq .Channel "npm"}}
```sh
npm install -g getdr
npx getdr saas.com
```

This package has no install scripts. npm picks the prebuilt binary for your platform from an optional
dependency (`getdr-linux-x64`, `getdr-darwin-arm64`, `getdr-win32-x64` and so on), and `getdr` runs it.
Linux, macOS and Windows on x64 and arm64 are covered.
{{- else}}
```sh
pipx install getdr
uv tool install getdr
pip install getdr
```

The wheels hold the prebuilt static binary for your platform and no Python code; nothing runs at install
time. Linux (glibc and musl), macOS 11+ and Windows on x86_64 and arm64 are covered.
{{- end}}

Homebrew: `brew install index-pages/tap/getdr`. Docker: `ghcr.io/index-pages/getdr`.

## Get a free Ahrefs API key

Requests to the Domain Rating endpoint are free, but need an API key: sign up for a free
[Ahrefs](https://ahrefs.com/) account, open Account settings → API keys, create a key and export it:

```sh
export AHREFS_KEY=your-key
getdr key check
```

## Quick start

```sh
getdr saas.com                          # card on a terminal
getdr a.com b.com c.com                 # several targets, sorted by DR
getdr -f domains.txt --format json      # NDJSON, one object per line
cat domains.txt | getdr > dr.tsv        # pipe: tab-separated domain and DR
getdr saas.com --version dr4            # the new DR formula
```

All flags, output formats, the config file and the HTTP API: [index-pages.com/getdr/]({{.Homepage}}).

Domain Rating data comes from [Ahrefs](https://ahrefs.com/) and is subject to the
[Domain Rating License](https://ahrefs.com/legal/domain-rating-license). getdr is not affiliated with Ahrefs.

